  "writing_rules": [
    "Load this template, the mission-runtime blank skeleton, and the missions_projects system contract before creating or structurally editing a mission owner.",
    "Gameplay reducers may mutate only an existing mission owner; offering or creation requires separately verified issuer, participant, timing, institutional authority, and an explicit operational briefing for player-facing missions.",
    "Participant, account, inventory, operation, health, knowledge, command, and institutional facts remain in their own authorities and are referenced rather than duplicated.",
    "Every nonterminal mission carries next_due_at or operation_ref; terminal settlement terms do not transfer assets unless their owning account authorities change in the same transaction.",
    "Briefings store only issuing-authority operational facts and explicit uncertainty; hidden opposition remains outside this owner until lawfully known.",
